  "hints": [
    "Use A, B and C as the three select inputs of every 8×1 MUX.",
    "The select combination ABC = 000 should activate only Y0.",
    "The select combination ABC = 001 should activate only Y1.",
    "Continue this pattern until ABC = 111, which should activate only Y7.",
    "For each MUX, connect exactly one data input to logic HIGH and all other data inputs to logic LOW.",
    "The position of the HIGH input determines which decoder output is generated.",
    "Connect the output of each MUX directly to its corresponding LED."
  ]
